## Reuse

- Detection pattern from `pkg/notify/zellij.go`: `os.Getenv("ZELLIJ")` → same pattern with `CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID`
- Exec pattern from `pkg/notify/zellij.go`: `exec.CommandContext(ctx, "cmux", args...).Run()`
- cmux CLI spec from `daemon/remote/cmd/cmuxd-remote/cli.go`: `notify` uses `--title` and `--body` flags

